n火憐ちゃん\nhttps://www.streetfighter.com/6/assets/images/character/juri/outfit/l/outfit01_c05.jpg\n他に良いと思う色や別衣装があればそれでも構いません\n髪型は元の二人のまま\n背景は神原邸の前を希望です\n\n楽しくバトルしようとする二人が見たいのでよろしくお願いします", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoakumasan/works/120", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 71308, "client_id": 597670, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdaf439/uploads/origins/6d2e617a-e927-4056-827d-21ec59606729?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a53dd7bfc4b40dae93818044d7e48f4d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfdaf439/uploads/origins/6d2e617a-e927-4056-827d-21ec59606729?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=66a592e426d7d63538910e93e4859d9e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "久しぶりです！\n\n今回のリクエストはうみねこのなく頃にの右代宮戦人です\n\nアンダーナイトの城戸灰都の服を着させてお願いします\n\nでも剣は赤いろじゃなくて青いろでお願いします\n\nそして戦人のとなりに右代宮縁寿も描いてください\n\nメルティブラッドのシオンの服を着させてお願いします\n\n全身イラストでお願いします\n\n背景を透明にしてください\n\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1doSgW_bGd71NOFVgKlykw-mWndbFO1AC?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aoakumasan/works/119", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 71308, "client_id": 2747599, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e5fe6fd/uploads/origins/19aef32c-a5f9-4d1d-8a02-791d8a14f8d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1ec51c458c9e41ae47bcebecfbf5de", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e5fe6fd/uploads/origins/19aef32c-a5f9-4d1d-8a02-791d8a14f8d4?bg=%23ff